### Login (usa email/password registrati)
POST {{miprimoprogetto_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{emailAdmin}}",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

### Refresh access token (HttpOnly cookie-based, NO body required)
### Flusso: browser invia cookie refreshToken automaticamente, ricevi nuovo access token
### Token rotation: vecchio refresh token revocato, nuovo refresh token nel Set-Cookie
POST {{miprimoprogetto_HostAddress}}/api/auth/refresh

### Login (usa email/password registrati)
POST {{miprimoprogetto_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{authEmail}}",
  "password": "{{authPassword}}"
}

### Logout (utente autenticato)
POST {{miprimoprogetto_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Blacklist token revocati (solo Admin)
GET {{miprimoprogetto_HostAddress}}/api/auth/blacklist
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}



### Create First Admin (bootstrap - solo prima volta)
POST {{miprimoprogetto_HostAddress}}/api/auth/create-first-admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Admin",
  "lastName": "System",
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "AdminPassword123!",
  "tipoDocumento": "DNI",
  "numeroDocumento": "98765432",
  "phoneNumber": "+39 000 000 0000"
}

### Delete the admin
DELETE {{miprimoprogetto_HostAddress}}/api/user/1
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}

